            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Jenny"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Added sliced frozen okra too early.. would wait till the end next time, but overall, a great recipe. Hubs loved it!",
            "datePublished": "2017-09-11T05:28:01.560Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Dwight"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Almost gave it four stars because I only put a teaspoon of sugar in them and they were plenty sweet enough. I didn't get to my greenhouse yesterday to pick my okra, so today they were 8 and 9 inches long. They grow so fast here that they were still tender and flavorful so I used them. This is my new favorite side dish. My 96 year old father who compares all my cooking to his mom's said, \"Hey, these are really good.\" and came back for seconds. That's like winning the Pillsbury Cook-off.",
            "datePublished": "2014-07-27T12:52:58.580Z"
          },
          {
