            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "LovesCooking"
            },
            "reviewBody": "What a great comfort food recipe. It’s the kind of dish that hugs you and feeds your soul. It is hearty and delicious. The bacon goes so well with the other components, adding a nice touch of smokiness. I would serve this lovely dish at any barbecue lunch/dinner, especially with some grilled corn on the cob.",
